window.products.push({"id":291191,"name":"Superior Premium Cotton Flannel Sheets, All Season 100% Brushed Cotton Flannel Bedding, 4-Piece Sheet Set with Deep Fitting Pockets - Pumpkin Paisley,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918t6gOc+iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"***Impressions is now Superior brand***  Affordable Luxury Linens Give your bed a stylish look and a trendy new layer of comfort with this 100-percent cotton flannel sheet set. The flannel is cozy and warm in winter and is equally comfortable in summer, thanks to the breathable cotton construction. Flannel fabric is more wrinkle resistant than standard cotton weaves, and is brushed on both sides to transform your bed into a blissfully cozy retreat. Available in a variety of sizes and in solid and paisley patterns, these flannel sheet sets are perfect to give an elegant look to your bedroom. The fully elasticized fitted sheet fits snugly on most mattresses that are up to 18\" deep. Pillowcases and flat sheets boast a classic 4\" hem for a neat, polished look.  A versatile color palette of grey, ivory, light blue, navy blue, pumpkin, and purple is a great way to update your décor. The perfect luxurious texture and rich colors mesh beautifully to complement your bedroom interior. Add matching duvet covers and extra pillowcases, or mix and match solid and paisley for a fantastic, coordinating look. This beautiful sheet set is machine washable, colorfast and wears extremely well. For drying, tumble dry low and remove promptly from dryer. Always follow care label instructions for best results. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: “OMG these are so soft and warm” “Fabulous! Exactly what I wanted… Washed well. Soft and will only get softer” “I love these sheets, in fact after sleeping in them 1 night I went and bought another set” “The sheets are super soft and they wash very nice and stay so fluffy. Love them” “We love these sheets so much that we ordered another pair. Our mattress is 15\" deep so we have a hard time finding sheets that stay on. These are so soft and comfortable and the fit is excellent!!” “I LOVE THESE SHEETS...fantastic to sleep on...very warm....nice deep pockets...would buy again!” And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918t6gOc+iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B0C62SMCXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C62SMCXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C62SMCXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
