window.products.push({"id":291241,"name":"Novilla King Box Spring, 4-Inch Metal Box Spring Supports for All Types of Mattress/Extra-Strong Support & Non-Slip, No Noise, Easy Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ultesVc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Novilla has been committed to researching better bedding for everyone to sleep well and love well. This box spring is designed to extend the life of the mattress while distributes weight and provides support and stability to reduce mattress movement. The complete frame is wrapped in a polyester cover. While easy to transport, this bed frame can be stored in tight spaces and readily assembled in any bedroom space to meet your needs. Why choose Novilla box spring? · Steel-frame box spring provides sturdy support · Box spring fits standard-sized bed frames and mattresses · Easy transportation and storage · Adds an extra 4'' height to your mattress What's in the box? · 1x box spring · 1x box spring cover · Tool and screw parts · 1x Novilla manual Six sizes available: · Twin size box spring: 74''x38'' · Twin XL box spring: 79''x38'' · Full size box spring: 74''x53'' · Queen size box spring: 79''x59.5'' · King size box spring: 79''x75.5'' · California king size box spring: 83''x71.5'' About warranty: Novilla offers a 5-year warranty to ensure your product durable support. So you can use this bed box spring with confidence. Note: Please check all packing materials carefully when receive it to ensure all components are present. If any parts are missing or defective, please get in touch with our customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ultesVc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novilla","source_asin":"B09SMFW3DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SMFW3DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SMFW3DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291242,"name":"Giza Cotton Sheets Cal-King Sheets-Giza Cotton Sheets California King Giza Sheets, 100% Certified Long Staple Giza Cotton Sheets Set Cal-King Giza Cot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ArO+qfpkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Giza Cotton HIGHEST QUALITY BEST COTTON SHEETS - New Better & Improved Version - If you love luxury and durability of hotel cotton bed sheet and the look of crisp pillowcases, you’ll adore our Breathable Cal-King Sheets, We use yarns made with 100% long staple cotton fiber and a gorgeous sateen weave. Our eco-friendly sheets retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Indulge in soft giza cotton bed sheets with detailed hem, available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, King, and Split King sizes. SIZE INFORMATION - 1 Cal-King Fitted Sheet (72\"X84\"), 1 Cal-King Flat Sheet (108\"X102\") And Two Standard Pillowcases (20\"X40\"). Will snugly fit all mattresses 12\"-18\" deep! You can buy any size, everything fits perfectly. There are many choices for color and you can pick one that suits your bedroom décor – modern and traditional both. Our heavyweight bed linen will surely upgrade your home style quotient. ULTRA-SOFT GIZA COTTON SHEETS WITH LUSTROUS SATEEN WEAVE - Give into the look and feel of hotel-like bed sheets and smooth pillow cases with our sheet set. Made of 100% natural and sustainable long-staple giza cotton, and lustrous sateen weave, the premium Giza cotton sheet sets are densely woven to be long-lasting, ultra-soft, and authentic, unlike cheap microfiber sheets with a lower thread count which look worn out and tear easily after few washes. SUSTAINABLE & LUXURIOUS - These bed sheet sets are made of extra long staple 100% pure giza cotton yarns, which are renowned for their superior quality and durability. Sateen Weave offers a lustrous look like silk, yet more breathable and natural. These eco-friendly sheets also retain softness for a lifetime and resist fading. Giza cotton products tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a few washes to experience the silky softness. Wash Care: The Sheet set is cotton so it demands very less care compared to other low-grade sheet sets. However, for experiencing the product at its best, we recommend gentle machine wash in cold water before use and do not bleach. Tumble Dry Low If Needed and wash dark colors separately preferably use laundry mesh washing bags. Guaranteed Satisfaction: We are committed to quality and customer satisfaction. In case you face any problem, you can write to us directly and get your grievances addressed immediately. Use contact seller option to raise complaints. Our Cal-King bed sheets are great gift ideas for Christmas, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Valentine’s Day and New Year’s gifts. Order our california king sheet set for the most comfortable experience. Leave a feedback after your purchase. Happy sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ArO+qfpkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shreem Linen","source_asin":"B08F3N7NXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F3N7NXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F3N7NXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
