window.products.push({"id":291266,"name":"ICERO Adhesive Hat Hooks for Wall (16-Pack) - Hat Rack for Disney Ears - No Drilling, Sticking Them up Or Places to Drill for a Fixture - Strong Hold,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C8d-yelyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"hat hooks for wall ✔️ 【MINIMALIST DESIGN】 - Our hat holder is designed to showcase your hats, not the hook. When your hats are hanging, our hooks are mostly hidden from view.If your wall is even & smooth walls, No drilling or damage, just peel if off and stick it.If your wall is uneven or rough, please install the mount onto the wall with SCREWS. ✔️ 【DURABLE & STRONG】 - Wall hat rack uses strong 3M adhesive that holds up to 3 pounds. CAUTION: We use a strong adhesive to ensure your hooks stay mounted over time. Due to strong adhesive, please place the hook on a surface that does not tear. Do not use on wallpaper and rough surfaces. Use carefully on drywall and painted walls. ✔️ 【PRESERVE HAT SHAPE】 - Our hat rack for wall design is curved to keep your hats damage-free. Other conventional hooks or nails put too much weight on a single point on the back of your hat, warping hats. ✔️ 【MULTI-FUNCTIONAL】 - Excellent hat storage solution for many types of hats including baseball caps, snapbacks, fitted hats, visors, and flat-brim hats. The hat hanger can also be used as a headphone hanger and other household items. ✔️ 【ROOM DECOR】 - Arrange the hooks however you'd like to create a stylish hat display. Unclutter your room within minutes with our easy-to-install hat organizer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C8d-yelyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICERO","source_asin":"B0B4ZMP1KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4ZMP1KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4ZMP1KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
