window.products.push({"id":291366,"name":"KangYao Chocolate Melting Pot, Candy Chocolate Melting Fondue Set, Candy Melter, Electric Chocolate Melting Oven Gift Set, Strawberry Melting Chocolat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j7KH9a9pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you want to make lovely DIY chocolates for your favorite chocolates ? This chocolate melting machine is the best choice for you to make chocolate . It helps you melt chocolate without water and has reusable molds to make unique chocolate blocks . Buy one and make delicious at home ! Specification : Machine material: ABS+stainless steel Power: 25W Diameter inside the pan: about 8.5 cm/3.35 inches Depth inside the pot: about 5.8 cm / 2.28 inches Dimensions (LxWxH): Approx. 19 x 14.5 x 10 cm/7.48 x 5.71 x 3.94 inches Weight: approx. 589g . Package contains:  1 x Chocolate Melting Pot  1 x spiral fork 1 x flat fork 1 x spatula 7 x molds 1 x iron mesh 10 x plastic forks Instructions for use. 1. Cut the chocolate into small pieces and place them in a large bowl . 2. Connect the appliance to the power supply, increase to level 2 (approx. 70°C) and continue to stir . 3. Once the chocolate is completely melted, turn to level 1 (about 40°C) .  4. Put the melted chocolate into the mold .  5. Refrigerate for about 5 minutes, then freeze for about 60 minutes .  6. Shape and remove . Caution: 1. Do not immerse the chocolate melter in water . 2. The oven and plastic molds are not dishwasher safe . Cautions :  1. If you need any adapter, please note  2. Please allow 0-2cm error due to manual measurement Thank you for your understanding  3. Due to inconsistent monitor calibration, the color of the items shown in the photos may be slightly different from the actual product Please refer to the actual product","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j7KH9a9pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KangYao","source_asin":"B0B1YGWPCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1YGWPCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1YGWPCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
