window.products.push({"id":291400,"name":"Rusticity® Indian Rosewood Antique Designer Butler Serving Tray for Hot & Cold Drinks/Vintage Rustic Decorative Handmade Sheesham Food Platter for Din","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p30b7wIzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you love to have breakfast in bed? It is something everyone enjoys and no matter how old you are. This Rusticity Rosewood Serving Tray would be the best choice for you. Whether you’re delivering juice and eggs or would prefer to carry drinks outside for guests, this natural tray should be there to beautify your interior home decor. This ethnic tray is constructed of premium quality sheesham wood material which is highly durable in nature and more beautiful than regular wood. This rustic color is not harmful to food or beverages. This butler tray with the handcarved designs on the surface to lend charm and vintage look everywhere. The designer handles provides comfortable grip while you hold and serve to your guests. It allows you to move this tray from place to place with ease. This tray is large enough to place small plates for easy serving of food items. The high sides will stop your little bowls from sliding off. You can display them on a coffee table to hold candles and vases. The tray can also be used to decorate the buffet tables and sideboards. This rustic tray is used for serving tea, snacks, coffee, finger foods, cakes cheeses, breads and crackers great for parties and events. You can also use it as a hallway tray for keys, small serving dish for entertaining guests or on a side table for display. The wooden tray is heat resistant so that you can serve hot tea and other hot snacks without any trouble at all. It provides a perfect touch to your kitchen and dining collections. This handcrafted tray will make a unique individualistic statement when you place it in your house and adds a distinctive and classy touch when kept on the dining table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p30b7wIzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rusticity","source_asin":"B01H2B9KLO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H2B9KLO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H2B9KLO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
