window.products.push({"id":291456,"name":"Momtail 70 Pcs Clothes Hanger Connector Hooks,Closet Hanger Hooks,Used in Standard Closet Hangers Space Saving,Thickened Colorful Hook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-OAHVuEML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍High-quality Build: This cloth hanger hooks is made of high-quality PP plastic, with beautiful and reasonable design positioning, strong structure, novel design, fine workmanship, fashionable style and high grade. Which is lightweight and durable, without any odor. Hand polished to ensure smoothness and will not scratch clothes and skin. ⌛Save Space and Time: The vertical space of the closet can be fully utilized by this clothes rack space saving hook. Clothes can be sorted by style so you can quickly find the clothes you want as soon as you open your closet. 🛋️Wide Range of Use: The Momtail hanger hooks connector is great for storing and organizing clothes, you can hang pants, coats, jackets, shirts and skirts on it, it can also be used to hang towels,belts, bags and other small accessories. You can even give this space saving clothes hangers hooks as gifts to friends. ✔️The Right Size: Each hanger hook has a height of 4.5 cm/1.77 inches, a width of 2 cm/0.79 inches, and a slot diameter of 0.9cm/0.35 inches, which fits most standard hangers, such as plastic hangers with a diameter of less than 0.35 inches, velvet hangers, etc.Closet hanger connector hooks,It maintains a good balance, holds your clothes securely and can hold up to 20 lbs. ❤️Packaging and Product Service: The whole package consists of 70 hanger hooks (including 19 white hooks, 17 pink hooks, 17 blue hooks and 17 green hooks),closet hooks for hanging clothes,which is enough to redesign your closet.We have built a great service team just to provide you with satisfying shopping experience. Buy it now! Your closet will become cleaner and neater.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-OAHVuEML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Momtail","source_asin":"B09VKGJS5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VKGJS5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VKGJS5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291457,"name":"West & Fifth Mermaid Scale Plastic Tumbler with Lid & Straw | Reusable BPA Free Water Bottle | For Water, Coffee, Cold Brew & More (Black, Holographic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719WTw5BvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need a way to keep your water or iced coffee cool throughout the day? West & Fifth introduces our handy reusable tumbler, the perfect cup for cold liquids that stands out from other tumblers. The outside features a unique matte oor holographic mermaid scale/ water fall design. This plastic tumbler holds 3 cups of your favorite beverage and maintains the temperature inside for hours to keep your drink cool and refreshing. The lid has a special rubber ring that keeps it twisted on tight while preventing any spill or leak accidents, and each straw has a stopper ring on the base that keeps it from falling out and adds extra leak protection. Made with sturdy plastic and safe food-grade materials, this sturdy tumbler can withstand daily use as you go from one activity to the next. It is lightweight enough to carry to the office, to your car, to the gym, or around your home, and it holds 24 oz. of liquid. Wrap up this grid-patterned tumbler to give to your loved ones as a fun way for them to stay hydrated while expressing their style. Find the cup you’ll love with our reusable tumbler options!All of our tumblers are 100% free from BPA, BPS, phthalates, and mercury for your safety and convenience. To wash your water and iced-coffee tumbler, remove the lid and the straw to clean the inside of the cup. Wash the cup by hand in a sink, and let it dry before the next use. This tumbler should not be used with hot liquids. Do not put this item in the dishwasher or in the microwave.At West & Fifth, we believe that there’s no such thing as a one-size-fits-all product. All of our products are exclusive, as they are designed in-house using fun, vibrant, fashion-forward, and custom colors and designs. Since inception, we’ve designed and launched over a thousand other quality products. We’re constantly bringing new products to market to fit with current seasons, colors, and trends that we’re sure you’ll love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719WTw5BvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West & Fifth","source_asin":"B0BQ44DLP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ44DLP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ44DLP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
