window.products.push({"id":291460,"name":"Laguiole 7-Piece Healthy Nonstick Stainless Steel Cookware Set, Greblon Coating Frying Pans, Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+W4K4de2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE YOUR KITCHEN EQUIPMENT: The Laguiole 7-piece cookware set includes 3 saucepans, 3 frying pans and a convenient, ergonomic and removable handle, to cover all your different cooking needs. Easy to use and particularly space saving, these stackable pots feature a top-quality stainless-steel body, while the pans have 2 layers of reinforced ceramic with stone effect and Greblon coating that are ultra-resistant to abrasion. INVEST IN HIGH QUALITY & PERFORMANCE: Ideal for equipping a new kitchen or replacing your old cookware, our 7-piece cookware set is the most efficient, reliable, and stylish choice you can make. The encapsulated base allows for rapid and even heat distribution throughout the surface, resulting in perfectly cooked, juicy delicacies, every single time. THE HEALTHY APPROACH TO COOKWARE: Thanks to their high-quality stainless-steel saucepans and their special, Greblon coating fry pans - which is a much healthier alternative to regular, non-stick coating technology, is great for cooking your favorite meals to perfection without the use of oil or other chemical coatings. Suitable for gas, electric, or induction cook tops. SAFE AND HEALTHY COOKING FOR A LIFETIME: Perfectly safe for ovens and broilers (up to 450°F without the handle), this sauce and frying pan set is free from GenX, APEO, BPA and PFOA, allowing you to cook in the healthiest possible way. Plus, the improved surface structure with excellent corrosion and abrasion resistance properties makes this set a longer lasting and sustainable option. LAGUIOLE EXCELLENCE SINCE 1829: Designed in the historic village of Laguiole in France, every single item of cutlery or cookware is a true statement of excellence. With a long and proud history of cutlery making that originates back in 1829, Laguiole is your trusted source of outstanding cookware signed with professionalism and unparalleled customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+W4K4de2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAGUIOLE","source_asin":"B08KSJSCP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSJSCP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSJSCP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
