window.products.push({"id":291561,"name":"VELMADE Suction Corner Shower Caddy Bathroom Shower Shelf Storage Basket Wall Mounted Organizer for Shampoo, Conditioner, Plastic Shower Rack for Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EYtrEdPAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO INSTALL - The shower caddies corner make full use of corner vertical space for bathroom or Kitchen. You can install the small corner shelf for shower insert in one second. Just strong press down the \"PUSH\" suction pad with your palm to squeeze the air out till you hear a “puff” sound, the shower suction basket will stick to the wall firmly. No drilling, no screws, no holes, no glue, no tools to apply the suction cup corner shower shelf. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS WALL SURFACES - Shower corner caddy are only stick on smooth, non-porous surfaces like metal, glass, tile, stainless steel and acrylic but not apply to uneven tiles, texture plate, unfinished marble, wallpaper, painted wall, etc. If you have any question about our items, please contact us by message, we are glad to help you solve the problem. WARM TIPS - 1.Please clean and dry the wall before installation. 2.Don't stick this suction cup corner shower caddy to the grout lines.3.Try to keep the two suction cups on a level line without tilting.4.If you are not sure whether the installation is successful, watch the shower storage basket for a while before placing items to make sure they do not fall. POWERFUL & REUSABLE - The corner bathroom caddy is made of premium ABS material and TPE suction cup hook adopts patented octopus bionic technology, shower caddy with thicken plastic can hold up to 22 lbs and stick sturdy for years after installation without any concerns. The corner suction shower shelf is smaller than other and is better suited for small bathrooms like trailers, apartments, dormitories, bathtub and counter top. BOTTOM DRAINAGE DESIGN - Corner shower caddy suction cup has many drain holes at the bottom, it can drain water quickly without ponding, and keep your shower gel and shampoo dry all the time. 2 buckles on the back of plastic shower caddy for adjusting position that perfectly fit various degree corners. (You can install the 2 hooks on the same side for a curve corner)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EYtrEdPAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VELMADE","source_asin":"B092QM7SDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092QM7SDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092QM7SDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291562,"name":"White and Placid II by Chris Paschke, 35x35-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MSUN0yuWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an abstract composition of brown, grey, and tan brushstrokes on a cream background. Chris Paschke's comfort with the Sumi brush and continuing study with Asian masters have brought her 'lovingly into the world of passive, peaceful Zen concepts, and the simplicity of an Asian artist.' the minimalism she brings to wild Apple in her soft grasses, floral, characters and handmade papers continues to flourish with new visions, colors and textural studies. Many trips to China have fueled her desire to learn more about the art form, and have LED her to create a living environment in the mountains of central California. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MSUN0yuWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B075STGC78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075STGC78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075STGC78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291563,"name":"Cuisinart Stainless Steel Griddler Deluxe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NqrSpIBxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cuisinart GR-150 Griddler Deluxe Take Meals to New Heights The Cuisinart Griddler Deluxe takes grilling to new heights! It offers six enticing cooking options. The reversible grill and griddle plates, combined with dual-zone temperature control, give home chefs complete control. This grill is perfect for making pancakes and eggs for breakfast, panini and open-faced sandwiches for lunch, and burgers or fajitas for dinner. The extra-large grilling surface is ideal for entertaining a crowd or making family meals. The new SearBlast feature locks in the flavor of steaks. With dishwasher-safe accessories, an elegant new look, and 1800 watts of power, deluxe is an understatement. Product Benefits Six Ways to Cook: 240 square inches of cooking surface handle big orders of bacon and eggs, panini sandwiches, seared filets, and saut?ed vegetables. Enough Power to Sear: 1800 watts of power and 500?F max plate temperatures let you sear meats, fish, and poultry. The 2-minute SearBlast feature locks in flavors. DuoControl Heating Advantage: Independent temperature controls let you warm tortillas on one plate while saut?ing chicken and veggies on the other. Makes combination cooking easier than ever. Adjustable Top Cover for More Cooking Options: The top cover \"floats\" for classic contact grilling and manually adjusts to 6 different heights to top-melt. Perfect for open-faced sandwiches and grilled pizzas. Extra-Large Cooking Surface: Cook up to 12 pancakes on the full griddle or grill up to 6 burgers in the contact grill position. Quick & Easy Cleanup: Removable plates, drip tray, and scraper are dishwasher safe. Product Features Reversible nonstick plates flip from grill to griddle, provide a total of 240 square inches of cooking surface, and are dishwasher safe. Grill side is perfect for grilling steak, burgers, chicken, and vegetables. Use the griddle side to prepare pancakes, eggs, heat tortillas, even sear scallops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NqrSpIBxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B0861GLNRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0861GLNRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0861GLNRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
