window.products.push({"id":291616,"name":"thinkbaby BPA Free Bento Box, Blue (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qwL-GKKiL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description thinkbaby's Feeding set furthers our mission by providing safe, sustainable, functional and elegant products for little ones. In the development of our BPA Free Feeding system, thinkbaby continues the mission by providing a feeding set free of BPA, phthalates, nitrosamines, lead, and PVC. Our Feeding set is also free of Melamine. Early laboratory research has shown melamine based tableware to leach melamine at various temperatures and when combined with other chemicals (such as formaldehyde and cyan uric) have the potential to pose a risk. As we expect the debate to begin on the safety of this chemical, the research we reviewed caused us ask a simple question. Does the product have to have melamine. Nope. So we built our set to be completely free of it. The Feeding Set was designed for a wide range of feeding ages. The set becomes useful from the moment that your doctor green lights solid food feeding to school days and beyond. Parents find the set is perfect for feeding and food storage. For traveling in the baby bag or in lunch boxes the Bento box is the ideal, no leak solution. We also included the Kids cup for when your child grows out of the Sippy cup range. And there is no reason for the set to be only useful for your toddlers. We receive emails and calls from parents all the time that are using the set for food storage and transport. From the Manufacturer After tremendous requests, thinkbaby now presents its feeding set items as separates. Designed free of toxic chemicals such as bisphenol-a (BPA), phthalates, melamine, nitrosamines, lead, PVC, and biologically harmful chemicals. The thinkbaby bowl is perfect for cereal, soup or any mealtime snack. The interior is made from food grade stainless steel, and then insulated with polypropylene. The bento box is also outfitted with a lid, which we made slightly orange so that it is easy to locate in the lid drawer. Perfect for the beginning solid food eater to adults.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qwL-GKKiL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thinkbaby","source_asin":"B002ZLONAA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002ZLONAA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002ZLONAA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
