window.products.push({"id":291629,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Blue Wine Opener with Foil Cutter and Corkscrew","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GRkQBws4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pinzon's easy-to-use wine opener effortlessly extracts a cork from any wine bottle in three seconds with simple lever action. Comfortable handles easily clamp onto a bottle's neck; the steel lever drives the tough, Teflon-coated worm into the cork with a push and then pulls the cork out cleanly with a simple pull. Releasing the cork involves the same action, only with the handles clamped onto the cork. The eye-catching opener is ruggedly constructed of blue transparent plastic with a heavy-duty steel gear mechanism, and opens one-thousand bottles in its lifetime. It comes with a squeeze-and-twist foil cutter to strip away the foil covering a cork, and a replacement worm. Hand washing is recommended to preserve the beauty of the wine opener.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GRkQBws4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B001BXBILA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001BXBILA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001BXBILA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291630,"name":"Universal 5 Piece Air Fryer Accessory Pack for Gowise Phillips or More Brand Air Fryer Accessories Kit of 5 Fit all 3.7QT-5.3QT-5.8QT-Cake Barrel,Pizz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RE+nNlKuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air Fryer Accessory Set Includes: 1 x Cake Barrel,17.8*7.4cm 1 x Pizza Pan,17.8*2.5cm 1 x Metal Holder,17.8*2.5cm 1 x Silicone Mat,17.8*0.7cm 1 x Multi-Purpose Rack with Skewers,18* 18cm Production description： Cake Barrel: Bake your favorite cake, bread or quiche in the Cake Barrel! The even-wall construction allows for optimal heating, while the handle allows for convenience and easy maneuverability! Pizza Pan: Aside from experimenting with different pizza recipes, this Pizza Pan also provides the perfect surface for a variety of other treats! You can use it to make pancakes, eggs, potatoes, quesadillas or even giant cookies! With the air fryer accessories grill pan, the possibilities are limitless! Metal Holder: Maximize your cooking surface with the Metal Holder. Simply prepare your food as desired and place one layer of food in the air fryer basket as usual. Next, place this Metal Holder on top and finally add your second layer of food on the metal grate. Now you will have complete meals ready in no time! Multi-Purpose Rack with Skewers: The Multi-Purpose Rack not only maximizes your cooking space, but it also comes with 3 skewers. These skewers are perfect for vegetable and meat shish kabobs while the bottom layer is perfect for sides! Silicone Mat: The Silicone Mat provides you with a heat-resistant surface to place your hot accessories on. Use an oven-safe mitt to remove your accessory from the air fryer and place it on the Silicone Mat. WARNING: Not appropriate for children without adult supervision.  Do not touch the accessories until they have completely cooled! Cake Barrel and Pizza pan with anti-sticking coating, please don't wash it immediately after baking and not for dishwasher. This product will be heat very fast, please mind your hand. It’s better for you to wash it by dishwashing cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RE+nNlKuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maker2","source_asin":"B074QJJFYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074QJJFYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074QJJFYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291631,"name":"CustomGiftsNow Mommy Established EST. 2020 Stainless Steel Engraved Insulated Tumbler 20 Oz Travel Coffee Mug, Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qOlXpf1tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This double-walled stainless steel travel mug can be used for all types of holidays gifts including Christmas, Birthdays, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Valentines Day, Weddings, Anniversaries, Pregancy Announcements, Grandparents to be, Baby Showers, and more. The mug has a narrower bottom to fit most standard cup holders, Double-wall vacuum insulation with a clear lid. Not recommended for dishwashers, hand wash only. Holds up to 20-ounces of liquid. Do not use in a microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qOlXpf1tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CustomGiftsNow","source_asin":"B07PVDG6FQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PVDG6FQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PVDG6FQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":291632,"name":"Mr Sweets MacBean Coat of Arms, Crest & History 8.5x11 Print - Name Meaning, Genealogy, Family Tree Aid, Ancestry, Ancestors, Namesakes - Surname Orig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i2NWpYZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The images used are EXAMPLES of what the product(s) will look like. This COLLECTIBLE product is a 8.5x11 print. The Surname for this product is the first word(s) in the products title and the country of origin is indicated with the last three words in the product title. This print uses the earliest coat of arms associated with a bearer of the surname (last name) and the time tested surname etymology, a history of the name and its origins throughout the ages. If available, it includes the ancient origin of the name, spelling variations, early movement of the surname during the Middle Ages, noteworthy bearers from around 1400AD or earlier up to current day, and first settlers in North America. There may be different variations of Coat of Arms for each surname and the one we use is the oldest registered Coat of Arms verified in history. History of Heraldry: Heraldry, in its broad meaning, traditionally had to do with the functions of a herald. Heraldry arose almost spontaneously in Medieval Europe around the 12th Century, coinciding with the development of armor, and the time of the crusades. This resulted in distinctive insignia's being painted on the knight's shield and embroidered on his surcoat, which was the only means by which the warrior could be identified. The Perfect Gift: These prints look great framed and/or with matting! This product ships directly from the manufacturer so please contact us with any questions you may have prior to your purchase as changes after purchase are not possible. Can't find your name? Contact us along with the name you are interested in purchasing. Due to the nature of this product returns or exchanges are only granted if the product was damaged in transit. Make sure to check out the variations abailable as well! The larger print offers more historical information then the smaller print.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i2NWpYZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr Sweets","source_asin":"B08D8M32BQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D8M32BQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D8M32BQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
