window.products.push({"id":291847,"name":"Buyyyit Magnetic Basket Organizer Shelf Rack for Refrigerator Office File Foil Plastic Food Wrap Spice Holder with Hooks (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PWTzgFLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Magnetical Shelves for Refrigerator] Our magnetical refrigerator organizer has a large capacity with [10.25\"L x 3.6\"W x 6\"H] inches which can hold up 4~5 bottles of sauce (16 oz), or 10~12 spice jars, also can hold up 5 rolls of plastic wrap, foil or wax wrap, as well as 5 packs of packing bags. [Magnetical Baskets Organizer for Office, School, Home] You can use the magnetical basket organizer to hold all your files, folders, documents, papers, magazines and books for school and office. Or you might use the magnetical baskets organizer for an over door organizer to storage your daily used objects such as umbrellas, water bottles, facial tissues, etc. . [Reinforced Magnetism] With a large Magnetical Pad, our magnetical baskets are super Sturdy and Stable, can hold up to 14.3Lbs (6.5kgs). No Installation necessary-No drilling or assembly required, sticks on to any magnetic surface including iron, nickel, cobalt, stainless steel, and many rare earth metals. [High-Quality Rustproof Metal Baskets Racks Shelves] Made of durable steel construction. New mesh design, more space, and make it easy to reach what you want. The black glossy surface makes it easier to clean, and will never get rust. magnetical shelves, magnetical shelves for refrigerator, magnetical shelves, fridge magnet organizer, magnetical baskets, magnetical organizer, magnetical fridge shelves","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PWTzgFLpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buyyyit","source_asin":"B0BY7RJB95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY7RJB95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY7RJB95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
