window.products.push({"id":291858,"name":"Tribesigns L Shaped Desk with Storage Shelves, Reversible Computer Desk Gaming Desk for Home Office Workstation, Rustic Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h6RLOwyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.←？→ Left or Right？ You define it! Our L shaped writing desk with reversible shelf easily meet your different need whatever you want to put the shelf on the right side or left side. It can be installed in two ways to perfectly match your room space and maximally save the space of your home office. Define your own interchangeable corner desk! ~ 2.^_^ Free from Clutter at This Instant！A fantastic amount of of room is provided specially for your facility and daily-used items. Shelf space underneath is suitable for your CPU, in the meanwhile two tiers under the desktop are absolutely appropriate for your notebooks, books, and other knickknack. Plenty of desktop space is a great organizer for your monitor, printer, computer,mouse, books and other office supplies or gaming setup. This is the one that coincides your computer area and work space. 3. ▲ Solid Desk for Solid Price▼ Tribesigns puts the emphasis on quality. This L shape gaming desk is quite sturdy and durable for years use equipped with top E1 particle board and solid metal frame. At the same time the plastic feet pads is adjustable for preventing your smooth floor from scratching and keep the desk balanced. Let tribesigns computer writing desk accompany you in gaming time or working time. 4. ☈ Brainstorm Ideas for the Combination: As this corner computer desk for small space can be assembled by interchanging shelves, more combination way will be realized when you get more than one L shape standing desk. There are three methods to symmetrically place two corner desks with reversible shelf together. Referring to two ways showed in above picture and thinking about the third or even more combination way, is full of imagination and interest! 5. Super Warm Service& Super Easy Assembly ☛ It's SUPER easy to put together for our product comes with step by step instructions and all the tools, and board LABLED for you. Our professional and warm service team will provide corresponding solution once you meet anything wrong regarding this corner standing desk. If you need a nice budget corner desk, this is the one!!! Notice: ONLY ONE DESK CONTAINED, WIPE BY DRY CLOTH","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h6RLOwyrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B0BFR61P74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFR61P74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFR61P74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
