window.products.push({"id":291935,"name":"Grillinator Ultimate Firewood Log Carrier - Black - Heavy Duty Durable Tote Bag for Wood - Self Standing Design with Padded Handles - 16 Gallon Capaci","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6105M9XLHoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"EZ-LOAD DESIGN: While inferior, flimsy tote bags require you to hold them open while loading and then collapse when you step away to get more wood - The self standing Grillinator Firewood Log Carrier allows you to load it without having to hold it open. Enclosed design keeps all wood debris and chippings inside the bag, so no need to bust out the vacuum cleaner after you’ve unloaded everything. Get the job done in half the time with half the effort FINGER FRIENDLY HANDLES: Padded handles save your fingers, even when carrying a huge amount of firewood. No more handles that feel like razor blades under the weight of the wood. No need to sling a carrier over your back to get the job done either BUILT TOUGH MATERIAL: Constructed from premium oxford canvas. Double stitched hi-denier thread and PVC fused backing provides years of heavy use without tearing - even during the coldest, harshest winters. The waterproof material outworks and outlasts the competition. Plus it folds flat for easy storage SUPER SIZE STORAGE: Built for large logs with a spacious 2.24 cubic feet (16 gallons) of space. Perfect for transporting big chunks of oak and maple logs from your woodpile to your fireplace. Holds everything from beach gear to groceries or kids toys LIFETIME GUARANTEE: We’re so confident that you’ll love your Firewood bag as much as we do - we offer a no-questions-asked lifetime guarantee. If you’re not satisfied for any reason, at any time we’ll replace your bag or refund your money, it’s that simple","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6105M9XLHoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grillinator","source_asin":"B00WRHTNJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WRHTNJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WRHTNJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
