window.products.push({"id":291959,"name":"Heat Powered Stove Fan Hanging on Chimney Fireplace Fan 5 Blades Silent Operation for Wood Log Burner Fireplace Eco Friendly and Efficient Heat Distri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t23jxXcWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[WORKING PRINCIPLE] The new upgraded design, heat powered, does not need batteries and electricity or other energy, through thermal energy to kinetic energy, drive the fireplace fan rotation, burn less fuel, get more heat. Protect the environment and save energy. Quickly and efficiently disperse heat into your room. [WORKING TEMPERATURE] Never need to turn it on or off, Start working automatically. When the temperature reaches 50°C(122°F ), the fan starts to rotate. When the temperature is lower than 50°C(122°F ), the fan slowly stops rotating. The higher the temperature of the furnace, the faster the blades rotate. The operating temperature range is 122°F - 662°F (50°C - 350°C). Always use a fireplace thermometer to measure the temperature of the stove and make sure it stays within this range. [WHISPER QUIET] The fireplace fan silent operation. The only moving part is the blade assembly, The stove fan works at less than 25 db. So that you can enjoy the warm air in a quiet and comfortable environment. [PREMIUM QUALITY] The material is anodized aluminum, wear-resistant and anti-rust. Overheating protection, the in-built bi-metallic strip at the base of the stove fan is designed to raise the edge of the fan slightly and reduce the contact area of the heat source as the maximum operating temperature is approached to protect the motor and the moelectric module. [SPACE SAVING] Easy to install, the 5-blade stove fan can be attached directly to the chimney pipe of the wood stove, log burner or fireplace, can save more space. If you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t23jxXcWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gohantee","source_asin":"B095WNCBVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-291959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WNCBVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WNCBVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
